1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,809
VIGIL: Health monitoring a crew can act on when Earth is
minutes away. Pandanauts, NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026

2
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:12,702
On the way to Mars, a message to Earth
takes up to 22 minutes, one way.

3
00:00:12,707 --> 00:00:19,714
Five hazards: radiation, isolation, distance, gravity,
closed environments. Most astronauts are not doctors.

4
00:00:24,653 --> 00:00:28,913
Crew alerts show who needs help at a glance.

5
00:00:28,921 --> 00:00:33,583
Earth signal and the Crew-autonomous
badge: how far help is.

6
00:00:33,589 --> 00:00:38,886
Attention now: Arjun has a 38.3 °C fever.

7
00:00:38,888 --> 00:00:43,200
Mei has been losing sleep since day 22.

8
00:00:47,027 --> 00:00:56,109
Each body system takes the worst status of
its readings, linked to NASA’s named risks.

9
00:00:56,116 --> 00:01:01,325
Eyes: SANS, a NASA-named spaceflight risk.

10
00:01:05,284 --> 00:01:10,438
30-day trends with the safe range shaded.

11
00:01:10,441 --> 00:01:14,448
Every threshold shows its source.

12
00:01:16,778 --> 00:01:20,593
Problems sorted, most urgent first.

13
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:34,506
Four steps: confirm, check
danger signs, act, escalate.

14
00:01:34,509 --> 00:01:42,158
Re-measured: 37.4 °C. Status turns green.

15
00:01:42,162 --> 00:01:47,974
On the way to Mars, Earth’s reply is up to
44.6 minutes away, so the crew acts first.

16
00:01:52,504 --> 00:01:59,012
Everything done, timestamped, in a
few kilobytes for Earth’s doctors.

17
00:02:02,709 --> 00:02:08,662
Near Earth, the advice changes:
Ground-guided, reply in under 2 seconds.

18
00:02:08,664 --> 00:02:13,177
Hazards are re-ranked for the station,
and radiation days remaining change.

19
00:02:15,509 --> 00:02:22,322
Daily prevention: exercise,
sleep, check-ins, streaks.

20
00:02:23,055 --> 00:02:29,162
Wi-Fi off: Offline: running on device.

21
00:02:29,164 --> 00:02:33,373
No connection to Earth needed.
VIGIL runs on the device.

22
00:02:35,703 --> 00:02:40,312
Built on NASA data and
published health guidelines.

23
00:02:40,411 --> 00:02:47,419
vigil-pandas.vercel.app · github.com/Kuraam/vigil. Concept
demonstration with simulated data. Not a medical device.
